            <div xml:id="d386-a5">

                <pb facs="0539" n="437" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg437"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 5.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Department of State for Foreign Relations.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center">[From Le Moniteur.]</p>
                <p>That no one may be ignorant thereof, the department of foreign relations makes
                    known that it has received from the American legation at Port au Prince, the
                    official notice of which the following is a translation:<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d386-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p>Exact copy:</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Amilcar Duval</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chief of Division.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d386-f1" n="2" xml:id="d386-f1-content">
                <p>Here follows Minister Furniss’s note, No. 270, of May 2.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
